post-it: Can't hear sounds
symptoms:
	Sound is muted
		shows: the volume is muted in Windows
checks:
	Volume is on
		shows: the volume is muted in Windows
software steps:
	Connect the VGA cable to the computer
	Switch it on and wait for Windows to start
	Click the speaker by the clock and untick Mute
notes:
	NOTE - ONLY DUPLICATE ISSUE
